  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man walking shirtless on a beach with a rocky cliffside and ocean waves in the background. The overlaid text reads, 'it's gettin hot in here so take off all ur clothes,' which is a humorous, exaggerated, and suggestive statement implying that the heat is so intense that one should remove all clothing. The meme's intent is to create a comedic effect by juxtaposing the casual, natural setting with an absurdly extreme and provocative suggestion. There is no toxicity present in this meme; it does not target any specific group based on protected characteristics, nor does it contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic content. The humor is derived from the absurdity of the suggestion rather than from any form of discrimination or harm. The meme is intended to be lighthearted and satirical, playing on the idea of over-the-top reactions to heat in a beach environment.",
